@step Record when the activity started so the quarter is a valid obligation.
@setup aeat config profile edit docs-sequence-sandbox --quiet --accept-defaults --activity-start-date 2026-01-01
@step Open a Modelo 349 draft for the first quarter before any intra-community invoice is recorded.
aeat app modelo work create --modelo 349 --year 2026 --period 1T
@step Calculate the draft; with no intra-community invoice there is no operator record.
aeat app modelo work calculate --modelo 349 --year 2026 --period 1T
@step Check the draft; the report reads incomplete and names the empty required boxes.
@result aeat --format json app modelo work verify --modelo 349 --year 2026 --period 1T
@expect result.completeness_status == "incomplete"
@expect result.granted_verificado_completo == false
@expect result.missing_required_casilla_ids[0] == "op.codigo-pais"
@expect result.findings[0].kind == "missing_required_casilla"
@expect exit_code == 1
